{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "72b56b93-0d0c-8300-96f5-9abdfaf1d7fb",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T15:13:23-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:10:50-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:10:54-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. This is Bridget Hanlon. I'm calling about a catch basin at the corner of my street that's clogged with leaves. Every time it rains the water backs right up into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:11:06-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Is this from the recent rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:11:11-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the rain that ended Saturday, three days ago. It started Friday, so, two days of it, really. And it's been like this after every decent rain since the leaves came down in the fall. Nobody has cleaned it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:11:25-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And how deep did the water get in the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:11:29-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps on my car. Well, nearly the hubcaps. Let me be exact, it was just below the top of the wheel on Saturday morning. It took until Sunday afternoon to drain off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:11:41-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, that's a lot of standing water. So the drain at the corner is blocked with leaves, and the water's coming up your driveway. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:11:51-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Now, who do I call to get it checked? Is that you, or is it somebody else? Because I'd like a name or a number, I don't want to be passed around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:12:03-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's us. Public Works handles the catch basins. I can put in a request for a crew to inspect it and clean it out. I'll need the location, though. What's the street and the nearest cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:12:16-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, hold on, I'm looking at the clock. I do payroll for a small firm and I have to get the numbers in by four, so I'm a little pressed. Can we do this quickly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:12:28-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, absolutely. Just the corner location and a number where we can reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:12:34-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The number is 401-555-0180. As for the corner, I'd rather not say the address over this phone. Can you just log the complaint and have someone call me back for the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:12:45-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note it as a clogged catch basin backing into a driveway, up to the wheels after the weekend rain, and that you'll give the location on the callback. Your number is 401-555-0180, under Bridget Hanlon. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:12:59-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Hanlon, H-A-N-L-O-N. And please note it's been going on since the fall, not just this storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:13:06-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Noted, since the fall. Someone from the office will call you back, and I'll mark it so they know you're short on time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:13:15-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'd appreciate that. I have to run, it's ten after three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T15:13:20-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, Ms. Hanlon. Take care."
    }
  ],
